  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Is being Haken a profinite invariant amongst 3-manifolds? That is, if $M_1$ and $M_2$ are 3-manifolds so that $\\pi_1(M_{1})$ and $\\pi_1(M_{2})$ have isomorphic profinite completions, and $M_1$ is Haken, must $M_2$ also be Haken?",
